[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340770862","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909#issuecomment-3340770862","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110909","id":3340770862,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HIB4u","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T23:23:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T23:23:24Z","body":"Linking my comment from the [original PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110494#issuecomment-3325094460) so it doesn't get lost\r\n\r\n> note, the implementation here is incomplete since the shaders still read from the transform. Accordingly, they are reading from uninitialized data. As far as the GPU is concerned, you are using the same amount of memory bandwidth, and this introduces an error that will crash on some devices or provide invalid results on others.\r\n\r\nIn the future, please don't open a PR for the same changes. It is easier for us to keep the review history in one place instead of having to track multiple PRs","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340770862/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340772685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909#issuecomment-3340772685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110909","id":3340772685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HICVN","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T23:24:46Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T23:24:53Z","body":"> In the future, please don't open a PR for the same changes. It is easier for us to keep the review history in one place instead of having to track multiple PRs\r\n\r\nOP had to open a new PR, as they accidentally made the original PR have zero commits, which makes GitHub automatically close the PR. There's no way for anyone to reopen the PR in this case; it's a GitHub limitation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340772685/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548106881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909#issuecomment-3548106881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110909","id":3548106881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Te9CB","user":{"login":"JaredGivens","id":54290147,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjkwMTQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54290147?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens","html_url":"https://github.com/JaredGivens","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaredGivens/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T15:14:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T15:19:18Z","body":"After deeper investigation using RenderDoc, I found that GPUs pad per-instance attributes to 8 float32 for cache/alignment purposes, even when only 4 float32 are actually used. \r\n\r\nTherefore I think a better solution would be to expose the transform matrix directly to the shaders. Since the 2D MultiMesh transform already occupies 8 float32, allowing shaders to reinterpret the matrix or apply custom math gives users the same flexibility intended by the initial proposal.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548106881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548158072","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110909#issuecomment-3548158072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110909","id":3548158072,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TfJh4","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T15:22:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T15:22:35Z","body":"Can you edit the initial post to reflect the changes you made with this feature?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548158072/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https